Clinical Course: Unlike typical kidney failure where fluid is retained, your kidneys are uncontrollably dumping salt and water. This requires a specific regimen of high salt and high fluid intake, entirely contrary to standard kidney disease advice, to maintain your blood pressure.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Do not attempt to walk to the bathroom during the night without assistance. The combination of low blood pressure and darkness drastically increases your risk of a severe, life-altering fall.

PATIENT EDUCATION

